# ============================================================
#  EmailJS credentials for the contact form
# ============================================================
#  Get all three values from https://dashboard.emailjs.com
#
#  1) VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID
#     Dashboard -> Email Services -> open your service.
#     Copy its "Service ID" (usually starts with "service_").
#
#  2) VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID
#     Dashboard -> Email Templates -> open your template.
#     Copy its "Template ID" (usually starts with "template_").
#
#  3) VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY
#     Dashboard -> Account -> General -> copy your "Public Key".
#
#  HOW TO FILL THIS IN
#   - Paste each value straight after the "=" sign.
#   - No quotes, no spaces:   VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_abc123
#   - Save the file, then restart "npm run dev".
#
#  IMPORTANT
#   - This file is git-ignored and is never uploaded to GitHub.
#   - On Vercel, add the same three variables under
#     Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables, then redeploy.
#   - Never use your EmailJS PRIVATE key here. Only the public key.
# ============================================================

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
